## A NIC added after the seed

The root adds the platform's NIC device; the platform restarts the VM so it sees the NIC
(TrueNAS: `truenas_vm_power`'s `restart_triggers`, keyed on the NIC devices); `stowage_vm_install`,
which depends on that restart, waits for the VM to answer, runs `network attach --role R --mac M`
for the role (its `interfaces`), reboots the VM and follows the reboot to the health gate's
verdict. A change of `interfaces` goes alone, without one of `version`.
